ors which are created by this type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when releaseAnchorReferences() is called by the Encoder. After this call the implementation will no longer be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"referenced by the Encoder and will itself be released."}],"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Yams\/documentation\/Yams\/RedundancyAliasingStrategy\/alias(for:)","doc:\/\/Yams\/documentation\/Yams\/RedundancyAliasingStrategy\/releaseAnchorReferences()","doc:\/\/Yams\/documentation\/Yams\/RedundancyAliasingStrategy\/remit(anchor:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RedundancyAliasingStrategy","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" : AnyObject","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"references":{"doc://Yams/documentation/Yams/RedundancyAliasingStrategy/alias(for:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/yams\/redundancyaliasingstrategy\/alias(for:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Implementations should return RedundancyAliasingOutcome.anchor(…) for the first occurrence of a value."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Subsequent occurrences of the same value (where same-ness is defined by the implementation) should"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"return RedundancyAliasingOutcome.alias(…) where the contained Anchor has the same value as the previously"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"returned RedundancyAliasingOutcome.anchor(…). Its the identity of the Anchor values returned that ultimately"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"informs the YAML encoder when to use aliases."}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"alias","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"for","kind":"externalParam